<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies, warm temps.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies, warm temps.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Friday were forecast to see sunny skies and warm temperatures, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies and a high of 22 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a mix of sun and cloud with highs of 17 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sunny skies and highs of 16 to 20 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
